Lac: Linux Air Combat ("LAC") is a free, open-source, multiplayer WWII-era
Lac: combat flight simulator designed specifically for Linux. Developed and
Lac: maintained by Robert Bosen (with community contributions), it evolved
Lac: from the older "GL-117" game into a full simulator emphasizing
Lac: accessible, high-performance air-to-air and air-to-ground combat.
